[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17282.868, "timestamp": "04:48:02", "text": "タミル語 いいえ、いいえ、ビクターは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17286.15, "timestamp": "04:48:06", "text": "タミル語で話していたのですが、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17287.91, "timestamp": "04:48:07", "text": "私の"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17291.59, "timestamp": "04:48:11", "text": "言語：マラヤーラム語。あ、待って、そう、DJ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17293.91, "timestamp": "04:48:13", "text": "も"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17297.75, "timestamp": "04:48:17", "text": "ええ、それが戻ってきたら。ええ、もし"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17300.47, "timestamp": "04:48:20", "text": "DJsc をお持ちですか"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17303.11, "timestamp": "04:48:23", "text": "チャットに入力できます。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17307.35, "timestamp": "04:48:27", "text": "はい、チャットに入力していただいて構いません。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17310.39, "timestamp": "04:48:30", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17316.31, "timestamp": "04:48:36", "text": "正直に言うと、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17329.67, "timestamp": "04:48:49", "text": "えっと、先ほどチャットでフジウンはいませんでした"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17334.07, "timestamp": "04:48:54", "text": "えっと、彼は「水筒を持ってるから」って書いたんだ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17337.59, "timestamp": "04:48:57", "text": "側面に。そこで彼はマラヤを書いた"}]